filter participants, but my view is changing to include various
non-public media as an important part of communications.

	I'll send my unsubscribe Jan 31st, but I'd still love to hear
any comments after that.  My major interest is information filtering
for USENET and online communities, especially *implementations* of such
ideas.  (A fair implementation often beats a great idea.)

